mbers: Ritsu, Mio and Tsumugi. Although disheartened at Yui’s lack of musical know-how, they still try to convince her to stay to prevent the club’s disbandment. After playing Yui a short piece which re-ignites her imagination, they succeed in keeping their new member and guitarist.\n\nAlong with the tasks of school and homework, Yui begins to learn the guitar with the help of the other band members, experiencing many mishaps along the way. However, with the school-festival drawing near and Yui getting stuck with her practice, will the Light Music Club be ready in time for their debut?\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Band","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Iyashikei","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rock Music","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":67,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"K-ON!","english":"K-ON!","native":"けいおん!","romaji":"K-ON!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"轻音少女"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"轻音！"}]},"trailer":{"id":"mFHue76hqt0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mFHue76hqt0/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}